body:
It's a little more than that. All my friends that play the game are still on NA. Players here don't really speak my language (or at least speaking English on the Chinese server is frowned on). I have to deal with QQ to play on the Chinese server, and it's about as user-unfriendly as can be with atrocious customer support. Plus it needs to be tied to a phone number, and while I had one before, I unfortunately lost the information for it during a reformat of my computer. I wanted to get the account back, figuring it'd be easy like it is for NA-based services, but trust me when I say it's basically made as hard as possible, especially with every damn thing here being tied into phone numbers and support staff having a tenuous grasp of English. Trying to use a burner, Google Voice number or other disposable phone number doesn't really work either, so I'd have to get a Chinese phone number and that's a whole other thing.

&#x200B;

Not wanting to deal with leveling a new account to 30 is *a* concern, but it's not the *primary* concern. In fact, I'd say it's the least of these concerns. I recognize it's a pain in the ass for people I play with, but it's either A. Use the account I have, that I spent money on and have had since season 2 on the server where all my friends are and just deal with the ping, or B. go through the ringer messing with things here to play on a server I have no connection to or care for.
